## Verification Checklist

When answering a question about a specific tool:

- [ ] Identify which version is running (check table above or run `docker ps`)
- [ ] Find the official documentation **for that version** (e.g., `docs.open-metadata.org/v1.12.x`)
- [ ] Cross-reference UI paths, API endpoints, and terminology with the versioned docs
- [ ] If the docs URL has a version selector, use it (e.g., `/v1.12.x/` not `/latest/`)
- [ ] If unsure, search the web for `"<tool> <version> <feature>"` before answering

