## OM 1.12.x Terminology Changes

These are **breaking changes** in OM 1.12.x compared to earlier documentation:

| Old Term (pre-1.12) | New Term (1.12.x) | Where |
|---|---|---|
| Ingestion tab | **Agents** tab | Service page |
| Add Ingestion | **Add Agent** | Service page → Agents tab |
| Add Metadata Ingestion | **Add Metadata Agent** | Service page → Agents tab |
| Add Profiler Ingestion | **Add Profiler Agent** | Service page → Agents tab |
| Add dbt Ingestion | **Add dbt Agent** | Service page → Agents tab |
| Ingestion Pipeline | **Agent** | Throughout the UI |
| Profiler tab (on table) | **Data Observability** tab | Table page |
| Data Quality tab (on table) | **Data Observability** → **Data Quality** sub-tab | Table page |
| Activity Feed tab | **Activity Feeds & Tasks** tab | Table page |

## OM 1.12.3 Table Page Tabs (verified)

Main tabs: `Columns` | `Activity Feeds & Tasks` | `Sample Data` | `Queries` | `Data Observability` | `Lineage` | `Contract` | `Custom Properties`

Data Observability sub-tabs: `Table Profile` | `Column Profile` | `Data Quality` | `Incidents`

## Update Protocol

After verifying a version or discovering a version-specific behavior:
1. Update the version table in this file
2. Update `knowledge-base.mdc` if a new pitfall was discovered
3. Update any guide (e.g., `GUIDE_OPENMETADATA.md`) with correct paths/terminology
